/P 347 0 R
/E (With great pleasure, I sincerely welcome each of you to participate in the second edition ofthe Ramazan Yaman Science High School Model United Nations Conference! As the Head of Academy, it is my privilege to see you all debating passionately about one of the most critical problems globally. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 347 0 R
/E (In the modern world, as crimes become increasingly complex and international, the reliability of justice systems has become largely dependent on the accuracy and preservation of evidence. The success of an investigation depends not only on identifying perpetrators but also on the lawful collection, preservation, and complete delivery of evidence to the judicial authorities. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 347 0 R
/E (Throughout our committee meetings, we will focus on issues such as ensuring the )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 347 0 R
/E (security of evidence, protecting the chain of evidence, developing international cooperation, and integrating new technologies into judicial processes. I believe that the ideas and solutions you, esteemed delegates, will put forward will contribute to the creation of more effective and reliable justice mechanisms in the future. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
